    "custom_multicolumns_xpBCAp": {
      "type": "custom-multicolumns",
      "blocks": {
        "column_W4R47Y": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "dynamic_costs": "",
            "custom_text_hover": "",
            "title": "",
            "show_text_double_column": false,
            "text": "<p>deVOL has finally made it to sunny California, with its beaches, palm trees and wonderfully diverse cultures. We can’t quite believe it, Loughborough to LA!!</p><p>Our showroom is in West Hollywood, just off the green and beautiful road that is Melrose Place, and in the very centre of LA’s Design District. 740 North La Cienega is deVOL’s new home, it is a deceptively large showroom, full of character and inspiration. There are six displays showcasing all our furniture and accessories in creative and calm rooms with plenty of vintage additions to make the spaces feel just like home.</p>",
            "show_above_image": true,
            "link_label": "",
            "linked_product": ""
          }
        },
        "column_fB3ekK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "link": "",
            "dynamic_costs": "",
            "custom_text_hover": "",
            "title": "",
            "show_text_double_column": false,
            "text": "<p>We have a powder room, a bar and some very English kitchens, we even have a tropical courtyard where you can take afternoon tea while one of our designers plans out your new kitchen.</p><p>We don’t know LA very well, so we would love you all to tell us your favourite places. We hope to feel like locals before too long. We can't wait to show you around our new showroom and talk to you about all things deVOL.</p>",
            "show_above_image": true,
            "link_label": "",
            "linked_product": ""
          }
        }
      },
